      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/e480ec/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-01T22:18:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a question about what happens when OblivAeon's countdown reaches 0. &nbsp;His card says \"An environment is removed from the game as per the rules on the Scion Reserve\", but it does not specify which environment. &nbsp;Does this mean the players choose which environment he destroys? &nbsp;That seems to be the implication, since the Inevitable Destruction card specifies to \"remove the environment in the battle zone with OblivAeon from the game\". &nbsp;Since OblivAeon moves to the battle zone of the environment he's destroying&nbsp;before he deals the 20 damage, it seems like you can use this to direct that damage to whichever battle zone you want when the countdown reaches 0. &nbsp;Is this the way it's supposed to work?</p>\n<p>Sorry if this has been answered somewhere else already;&nbsp;I checked the Fireside Chats thread and the rules clarifications before posting here and didn't find an answer.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:20.270Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
