      "raw": "<p>I have a question about what happens when OblivAeon's countdown reaches 0. &nbsp;His card says \"An environment is removed from the game as per the rules on the Scion Reserve\", but it does not specify which environment. &nbsp;Does this mean the players choose which environment he destroys? &nbsp;That seems to be the implication, since the Inevitable Destruction card specifies to \"remove the environment in the battle zone with OblivAeon from the game\". &nbsp;Since OblivAeon moves to the battle zone of the environment he's destroying&nbsp;before he deals the 20 damage, it seems like you can use this to direct that damage to whichever battle zone you want when the countdown reaches 0. &nbsp;Is this the way it's supposed to work?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sorry if this has been answered somewhere else already;&nbsp;I checked the Fireside Chats thread and the rules clarifications before posting here and didn't find an answer.</p>",
