      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-01T22:39:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>OblivAeon is actively in Battle Zone 1 or Battle Zone 2. &nbsp; If the Countdown reaches 0 in phase 1 or 2&nbsp;then the environment of the Battle Zone&nbsp;OblivAeon is currently in has all of its cards removed from the game. &nbsp;Step 2 on the Scion Reserve just mentions to move OblivAeon to that Battle Zone he removed the environment from incase something triggered which caused him to move inbetween before another environment deck is put into play, you're in phase 3 which has a hero removed in addition to the environment of the Battle Zone that the hero was in,&nbsp;or more likely because a Game Over condition of an environment occurred in a Battle Zone OblivAeon was not in. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:03:59.508Z",
