      "created_at": "2019-12-01T23:19:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok but that doesn't change the action. Unless otherwise stated effects from OblivAeon only affect the Battle Zone he is currently active in. &nbsp;The booklet makes no mention of removing an environment from either Battle Zone in Phase 1 or 2. &nbsp; For Phase 3 we have a ruling listed&nbsp;on what occurs there. &nbsp;</p>",
